Domain Entity InterventionPrescription
    documentation 'This entity represents a formal prescription of an instructional approach 
                  'focusing on the specific techniques and materials used to teach a given subject. 
                  'This can be prescribed by academic research, an interventions vendor, or another 
                  'entity.
    include EducationContentSource
        documentation 'Resources related to or used in this intervention prescription, including any 
                      'documentation around the InterventionPrescription itself. Since an intervention 
                      'prescription is intended to be a published intervention, an intervention 
                      'prescription should have at least one such resource.
        is required
    enumeration InterventionClass
        documentation 'The way in which an intervention is used: curriculum, supplement, or practice.
        is required
    descriptor Diagnosis
        documentation 'Targeted purpose of the InterventionPrescription (e.g., attendance issue, dropout risk).
        is optional collection
    enumeration PopulationServed
        documentation 'A subset of students that are the focus of the InterventionPrescription. 
        is optional collection
    enumeration Sex
        documentation 'Sexes for the InterventionPrescription. If omitted, considered generally applicable.
        is optional collection
        with context Appropriate
    descriptor GradeLevel
        documentation 'Grade levels for the prescribed intervention. If omitted, considered generally applicable.
        is optional collection
        with context Appropriate
    enumeration DeliveryMethod
        documentation 'The way in which an intervention was implemented: individual, small group, whole 
                      'class, or whole school.
        is required
    reference EducationOrganization
        documentation 'Relates the Education Organization which is sponsoring the InterventionPrescription.
        is part of identity
    shared string IdentificationCode named IdentificationCode
        documentation 'A unique number or alphanumeric code assigned to an intervention prescription.
        is part of identity
        with context InterventionPrescription
